<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="dc9f6883">&lt;p&gt;
    The technology architecture is typically comprised of infrastructure component diagrams, technology location
    diagrams and network diagrams that portray the overarching technology architecture solution.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    The technology architecture is an enabler for enterprise architecture work and is developed after agreement on the
    target business, application and data architectures has been reached. It can also provide governance by using the
    governance framework, established business and other information systems architectures.
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br /&gt;</attribute>
